{"id":"e1cda67d4ddf93f2","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-binary-extension-path.md","title":"二值延伸性质选择每棵可计算树的路径","display":"thm-binary-extension-path — 二值延伸性质选择每棵可计算树的路径","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-binary-extension-path","aliases":["20-thm-binary-extension-path"],"display":"thm-binary-extension-path — 二值延伸性质选择每棵可计算树的路径","chapter":"10","section":"10.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 10.3.3(iv)⇒(v)","source_printed_pages":[186],"source_pdf_pages":[218],"depends_on":["[[20-df-binary-extension-property]]","[[20-lem-tree-binary-choice]]","[[20-df-closed-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-binary-extension-path"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-binary-extension-path</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-binary-extension-path — 二值延伸性质选择每棵可计算树的路径"},{"key":"chapter","html":"10"},{"key":"section","html":"10.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 10.3.3(iv)⇒(v)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>186</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>218</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4a668d5b21b39c67\" href=\"?note=4a668d5b21b39c67\" title=\"20-df-binary-extension-property\">20-df-binary-extension-property</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fe7a8e5db6f59cf9\" href=\"?note=fe7a8e5db6f59cf9\" title=\"20-lem-tree-binary-choice\">20-lem-tree-binary-choice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BExt}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{BExt}(A)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=[T]\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(C=[T]\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是可计算二进制树。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4a668d5b21b39c67\" href=\"?note=4a668d5b21b39c67\" title=\"20-df-binary-extension-property\">20-df-binary-extension-property</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fe7a8e5db6f59cf9\" href=\"?note=fe7a8e5db6f59cf9\" title=\"20-lem-tree-binary-choice\">20-lem-tree-binary-choice</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}binary-extension-path}\\vdash\n\\exists X\\in C\\ [X\\le_T A].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}binary-extension-path}\\vdash\n\\exists X\\in C\\ [X\\le_T A].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi_T\">\\(\\psi_T\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算二值全延伸 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>。从空串开始，在节点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 上读取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(h^{-1}(\\sigma))\">\\(f(h^{-1}(\\sigma))\\)</span> 并附加该位：如果有死枝，程序已禁止它；若没有，任一位都活。归纳得所有节点可延伸，串长度逐次增加，其并为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算路径。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 10.3.3(iv)⇒(v)；印刷页 186；PDF 第 218 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-binary-extension-property","status":"resolved","id":"4a668d5b21b39c67","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-binary-extension-property]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-tree-binary-choice","status":"resolved","id":"fe7a8e5db6f59cf9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-tree-binary-choice]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-binary-extension-property","status":"resolved","id":"4a668d5b21b39c67","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-binary-extension-property]]；see [[20-lem-tree-binary-choice]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-tree-binary-choice","status":"resolved","id":"fe7a8e5db6f59cf9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-binary-extension-property]]；see [[20-lem-tree-binary-choice]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-binary-extension-property]]；see [[20-lem-tree-binary-choice]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{BExt}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"C=[T]\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}binary-extension-path}\\vdash\n\\exists X\\in 